{"id":"vd-b2-the-last-keeper","level":"b2","n":16,"title":{"en":"I Was Polishing the Lens When…","vi":"Tôi đang lau thấu kính thì…"},"summary":"Bên bếp lò trong hải đăng, ông Declan kể cho Maya chuyện lạ nhất từng xảy ra trên đảo: một con thuyền trôi dạt không người — luyện kể chuyện với các thì quá khứ.","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-b2-the-last-keeper","level":"b2","title":{"en":"The Last Keeper","vi":"Người giữ đèn cuối cùng"}},"scene":{"background":"sea-dawn","props":[{"id":"puppy","x":860,"y":900}]},"cast":{"maya":{"name":{"en":"Maya","vi":"Maya"},"look":"woman","x":520,"style":{"hair":"long","hairColor":"#1A1A1A","skin":"#F1D3B3","skinShade":"#DDBB98","outfit":"coat","top":"#AF601A","topShade":"#935116"}},"declan":{"name":{"en":"Declan","vi":"Declan"},"look":"grandpa","x":1160,"style":{"outfit":"jacket","top":"#1B4F72","topShade":"#154360"}}},"lines":[{"speaker":"maya","en":"Declan, what's the strangest thing that's ever happened to you here?","vi":"Ông Declan, chuyện lạ nhất từng xảy ra với ông ở đây là gì ạ?","ipa":["","wʌts","ðə","ˈstɹeɪndʒɪst","θɪŋ","ðæts","ˈɛvɚ","ˈhæpənd","tu","ju","hiɹ"],"start":0.554,"end":4.294,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,0.554],[1,1.309],[2,1.584],[3,1.709],[4,2.397],[5,2.671],[6,2.909],[7,3.209],[8,3.659],[9,3.772],[10,3.934]]},{"speaker":"declan","en":"The strangest? That would be the summer of ninety-four. I was polishing the lens just after dawn.","vi":"Lạ nhất à? Chắc là mùa hè năm chín mươi tư. Hôm đó tôi đang lau thấu kính ngay sau bình minh.","ipa":["ðə","ˈstɹeɪndʒɪst","ðæt","wʊd","bi","ðə","ˈsʌmɚ","ʌv","ˈnaɪnti-fɔɹ","aɪ","wɑz","ˈpɑlɪʃɪŋ","ðə","lɛnz","dʒʌst","ˈæftɚ","dɔn"],"start":5.084,"end":11.674,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,5.084],[1,5.178],[2,6.576],[3,6.811],[4,6.928],[5,7.032],[6,7.201],[7,7.579],[8,7.67],[9,9.144],[10,9.313],[11,9.509],[12,10.068],[13,10.212],[14,10.615],[15,10.928],[16,11.201]]},{"speaker":"maya","en":"And what happened?","vi":"Rồi chuyện gì xảy ra ạ?","ipa":["ənd","wʌt","ˈhæpənd"],"start":12.464,"end":13.384,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,12.464],[1,12.604],[2,12.816]]},{"speaker":"declan","en":"I looked out and saw a small boat drifting past the island. There was nobody in it, or so I thought.","vi":"Tôi nhìn ra và thấy một chiếc thuyền nhỏ trôi ngang qua đảo. Trên thuyền không có ai, hay ít ra tôi tưởng vậy.","ipa":["aɪ","lʊkt","aʊt","ənd","sɔ","ə","smɔl","boʊt","ˈdɹɪftɪŋ","pæst","ðə","ˈaɪlənd","ðɛɹ","wɑz","ˈnoʊˌbɑˌdi","ɪn","ɪt","ɔɹ","soʊ","aɪ","θɔt"],"start":14.174,"end":21.124,"gesture":"point","timing":[[0,14.174],[1,14.265],[2,14.526],[3,15.177],[4,15.372],[5,15.672],[6,15.776],[7,16.284],[8,16.596],[9,17.026],[10,17.429],[11,17.521],[12,18.749],[13,18.919],[14,19.088],[15,19.556],[16,19.674],[17,20.273],[18,20.442],[19,20.637],[20,20.754]]},{"speaker":"maya","en":"Had there been a storm?","vi":"Trước đó có bão ạ?","ipa":["hæd","ðɛɹ","bɪn","ə","stɔɹm"],"start":21.914,"end":23.134,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,21.914],[1,22.117],[2,22.304],[3,22.479],[4,22.554]]},{"speaker":"declan","en":"There had. It had been blowing hard all night, and I'd been watching the sea for hours.","vi":"Có đấy. Gió thổi mạnh suốt đêm, và tôi đã canh mặt biển hàng giờ liền.","ipa":["ðɛɹ","hæd","ɪt","hæd","bɪn","ˈbloʊɪŋ","hɑɹd","ɔl","naɪt","ənd","aɪd","bɪn","ˈwɑtʃɪŋ","ðə","si","fɔɹ","ˈaʊɚz"],"start":23.924,"end":29.904,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,23.924],[1,24.067],[2,25.153],[3,25.309],[4,25.452],[5,25.661],[6,26.077],[7,26.416],[8,26.702],[9,27.653],[10,27.809],[11,28.017],[12,28.2],[13,28.682],[14,28.812],[15,29.137],[16,29.333]]},{"speaker":"maya","en":"So what did you do?","vi":"Vậy ông đã làm gì?","ipa":["soʊ","wʌt","dɪd","ju","du"],"start":30.694,"end":31.754,"expression":"surprised","timing":[[0,30.694],[1,30.924],[2,31.161],[3,31.324],[4,31.474]]},{"speaker":"declan","en":"I took our little rowing boat and went out to it. It was hard work, I can tell you.","vi":"Tôi lấy chiếc xuồng chèo nhỏ của nhà và ra chỗ nó. Vất vả lắm, tôi nói thật.","ipa":["aɪ","tʊk","ˈaʊɚ","ˈlɪtəl","ˈɹoʊɪŋ","boʊt","ənd","wɛnt","aʊt","tu","ɪt","ɪt","wɑz","hɑɹd","wɝk","aɪ","kæn","tɛl","ju"],"start":32.544,"end":38.384,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,32.544],[1,32.651],[2,32.964],[3,33.12],[4,33.381],[5,33.706],[6,34.487],[7,34.644],[8,34.826],[9,35.06],[10,35.217],[11,36.094],[12,36.263],[13,36.419],[14,36.745],[15,37.435],[16,37.565],[17,37.747],[18,38.047]]},{"speaker":"maya","en":"And was it really empty?","vi":"Thế nó có thực sự trống không ạ?","ipa":["ənd","wɑz","ɪt","ˈɹɪli","ˈɛmpti"],"start":39.174,"end":40.534,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,39.174],[1,39.301],[2,39.514],[3,39.701],[4,40.051]]},{"speaker":"declan","en":"No! When I got close, a little brown dog put its head up and started barking at me.","vi":"Không! Khi tôi tới gần, một chú chó nhỏ màu nâu ngóc đầu lên và sủa tôi inh ỏi.","ipa":["noʊ","wɛn","aɪ","ɡɑt","kloʊs","ə","ˈlɪtəl","bɹaʊn","dɔɡ","pʊt","ɪts","hɛd","ʌp","ənd","ˈstɑɹtɪd","ˈbɑɹkɪŋ","æt","mi"],"start":41.324,"end":47.724,"expression":"happy","prop":"puppy","timing":[[0,41.324],[1,42.488],[2,42.657],[3,42.787],[4,43.022],[5,43.959],[6,44.063],[7,44.389],[8,44.727],[9,45.339],[10,45.548],[11,45.73],[12,45.964],[13,46.355],[14,46.524],[15,46.928],[16,47.345],[17,47.436]]},{"speaker":"maya","en":"A dog? How long had it been out there?","vi":"Một chú chó ư? Nó đã ở ngoài đó bao lâu rồi ạ?","ipa":["ə","dɔɡ","haʊ","lɔŋ","hæd","ɪt","bɪn","aʊt","ðɛɹ"],"start":48.514,"end":51.544,"expression":"surprised","timing":[[0,48.514],[1,48.591],[2,49.891],[3,50.129],[4,50.492],[5,50.716],[6,50.841],[7,51.016],[8,51.254]]},{"speaker":"declan","en":"About two days, it turned out. The boat had broken loose from a harbor on the mainland.","vi":"Hoá ra khoảng hai ngày. Con thuyền đã tuột dây khỏi một bến cảng trên đất liền.","ipa":["əˈbaʊt","tu","deɪz","ɪt","tɝnd","aʊt","ðə","boʊt","hæd","ˈbɹoʊkən","lus","fɹʌm","ə","ˈhɑɹbɚ","ɑn","ðə","ˈmeɪnˌlænd"],"start":52.334,"end":58.134,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,52.334],[1,52.65],[2,52.923],[3,53.73],[4,53.9],[5,54.186],[6,55.194],[7,55.363],[8,55.688],[9,55.91],[10,56.339],[11,56.665],[12,56.821],[13,56.912],[14,57.407],[15,57.537],[16,57.615]]},{"speaker":"maya","en":"The poor thing must have been utterly terrified.","vi":"Tội nghiệp, hẳn nó đã sợ chết khiếp.","ipa":["ðə","puɹ","θɪŋ","mʌst","hæv","bɪn","ˈʌtɚli","ˈtɛɹəˌfaɪd"],"start":58.924,"end":61.674,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,58.924],[1,59.019],[2,59.407],[3,59.757],[4,60.056],[5,60.219],[6,60.469],[7,60.919]]},{"speaker":"declan","en":"It was shaking like a leaf. Brigid wrapped it in a blanket and fed it half our dinner.","vi":"Nó run như cầy sấy. Brigid quấn nó trong chăn và cho nó ăn nửa bữa tối của hai vợ chồng.","ipa":["ɪt","wɑz","ˈʃeɪkɪŋ","laɪk","ə","lif","","ɹæpt","ɪt","ɪn","ə","ˈblæŋkət","ənd","fɛd","ɪt","hæf","ˈaʊɚ","ˈdɪnɚ"],"start":62.464,"end":68.274,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,62.464],[1,62.555],[2,62.699],[3,63.18],[4,63.389],[5,63.467],[6,64.63],[7,65.034],[8,65.386],[9,65.516],[10,65.659],[11,65.75],[12,66.74],[13,66.922],[14,67.208],[15,67.326],[16,67.677],[17,67.846]]},{"speaker":"maya","en":"Did you ever find the owners?","vi":"Ông có tìm được chủ của nó không?","ipa":["dɪd","ju","ˈɛvɚ","faɪnd","ðə","ˈoʊnɚz"],"start":69.064,"end":70.714,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,69.064],[1,69.217],[2,69.354],[3,69.667],[4,70.017],[5,70.129]]},{"speaker":"declan","en":"We did. A little girl had been crying for two days because she thought her dog had drowned.","vi":"Có chứ. Một cô bé đã khóc suốt hai ngày vì tưởng chú chó của mình chết đuối.","ipa":["wi","dɪd","ə","ˈlɪtəl","ɡɝl","hæd","bɪn","ˈkɹaɪɪŋ","fɔɹ","tu","deɪz","bɪˈkɔz","ʃi","θɔt","hɝ","dɔɡ","hæd","dɹaʊnd"],"start":71.504,"end":77.824,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,71.504],[1,71.634],[2,72.746],[3,72.902],[4,73.176],[5,73.54],[6,73.683],[7,73.853],[8,74.321],[9,74.478],[10,74.842],[11,75.819],[12,76.209],[13,76.366],[14,76.665],[15,76.834],[16,77.199],[17,77.329]]},{"speaker":"maya","en":"Oh, that's lovely. What happened when they came to collect it?","vi":"Ôi, thật dễ thương. Chuyện gì xảy ra khi họ đến đón nó ạ?","ipa":["oʊ","ðæts","ˈlʌvli","wʌt","ˈhæpənd","wɛn","ðeɪ","keɪm","tu","kəˈlɛkt","ɪt"],"start":78.614,"end":82.894,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,78.614],[1,79.042],[2,79.367],[3,80.842],[4,81.079],[5,81.567],[6,81.729],[7,81.879],[8,82.179],[9,82.317],[10,82.767]]},{"speaker":"declan","en":"She ran up the jetty and the dog nearly knocked her over. She still sends me a card every Christmas.","vi":"Cô bé chạy lên cầu tàu và chú chó suýt xô ngã cô. Đến giờ Giáng sinh nào cô bé cũng gửi thiệp cho tôi.","ipa":["ʃi","ɹæn","ʌp","ðə","ˈdʒɛti","ənd","ðə","dɔɡ","ˈnɪɹli","nɑkt","hɝ","ˈoʊvɚ","ʃi","stɪl","sɛndz","mi","ə","kɑɹd","ˈɛvɚi","ˈkɹɪsməs"],"start":83.684,"end":90.644,"expression":"happy","react":{"maya":"happy"},"timing":[[0,83.684],[1,83.83],[2,84.13],[3,84.247],[4,84.364],[5,85.25],[6,85.406],[7,85.549],[8,86.109],[9,86.461],[10,86.786],[11,86.942],[12,88.08],[13,88.301],[14,88.64],[15,88.978],[16,89.122],[17,89.213],[18,89.681],[19,90.033]]}],"words":[{"id":"polish","en":"polish","ipa":"ˈpɑlɪʃ","vi":"đánh bóng; xi đánh bóng; sự trau chuốt","level":3},{"id":"drift","en":"drift","ipa":"dɹɪft","vi":"trôi dạt; xu hướng, chiều hướng; ý chính","level":4},{"id":"storm","en":"storm","ipa":"stɔɹm","vi":"cơn bão; bão tố","level":1},{"id":"harbor","en":"harbor","ipa":"ˈhɑɹbɚ","vi":"bến cảng; nuôi (ý nghĩ, cảm xúc); chứa chấp","level":2},{"id":"blanket","en":"blanket","ipa":"ˈblæŋkət","vi":"cái chăn; mền","level":1},{"id":"terrified","en":"terrified","ipa":"ˈtɛɹəˌfaɪd","vi":"kinh hãi; sợ chết khiếp","level":2}],"focus":{"title":"Kể một câu chuyện (anecdote) với các thì quá khứ","pattern":"I was + V-ing when… · There had been… · I'd been + V-ing for hours · It turned out (that)… · How long had it been…? · What happened when…?","explain":"Quá khứ tiếp diễn làm nền: \"I was polishing the lens when I saw a boat.\" Quá khứ hoàn thành cho việc xảy ra trước đó: \"There 